  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Three more built-in language packs (ja-JP, ko-KR, fr-FR) shipped as embedded resources, ELELocalization.BuiltInLanguages now lists en-US/zh-TW/ja-JP/ko-KR/fr-FR; ELEScrollBar gains Reveal()/RevealDuration so an auto-hide bar floats out while the content scrolls and fades back after idle (Element Plus behavior); primary-semantic colors from ELEColor.GetTypeColor now follow ELEStyles.ActiveStyleColor so buttons/links/tags recolor instantly on theme switch, and the light theme primary returns to the classic #409EFF; fixed Segoe MDL2 code points for Sunny/Moon/Globe so ELEIcon renders the intended glyphs",
